# Structured editorial content; individual applications drive every page.
FLAGS=[
('canada','Canadian flags','A familiar symbol, specified for your setting.','For civic entrances, commercial properties, schools and ceremonies, choose a Canadian flag around how and where it will be displayed.','Outdoor exposure and flying frequency|Flagpole height and existing attachment style|Indoor ceremonial display or outdoor use|Single replacement or a coordinated order','Share the existing flag dimensions if available. A clear photo of the pole and attachment points helps identify the right replacement.'),
('provincial','Provincial & territorial flags','Represent the places that matter.','Bring provincial and territorial identity into civic displays, campuses, hospitality spaces and public events.','Province or territory required|Complete sets or individual flags|Consistent dimensions across a display|Display sequence and protocol requirements','List each province or territory and the quantity required. For a multi-flag display, include a photo or plan of the arrangement.'),
('international','International flags','A welcoming display for a wider world.','Specify international flags for visiting delegations, cultural events, hotels, sporting occasions and institutional displays.','Countries and quantities|Indoor stands or outdoor flagpoles|Matching display sizes|Event dates and delivery destination','Provide the country names in writing and any event protocol requirements. Confirm exact designs before production or supply.'),
('custom','Custom flags','Your idea. Ready to fly.','Bring original artwork to a flag made for your organization, occasion or outdoor space.','Artwork and reproduction rights|Finished dimensions and viewing distance|Single-sided or double-sided requirements|Attachment method and environment','Upload your logo or design with your quote request. Material, finishing and artwork suitability are reviewed before a production proof.'),
('corporate','Corporate flags','Put your identity in motion.','Give offices, dealerships, industrial sites and corporate events a consistent branded presence.','Brand guidelines and approved logo|Colour references and artwork files|Number of properties and poles|Replacement quantities and future consistency','Include your brand guide where available. If you manage several sites, share a location list and identify any differences in flagpole sizes.'),
('municipal','Municipal flags','Made for shared places.','Support municipal buildings, community facilities and civic events with flags specified around the approved municipal identity.','Approved crest or official artwork|Procurement and purchase-order requirements|Civic display arrangements|Seasonal replacement planning','Use artwork authorized by the municipality. Include delivery locations and any procurement documentation needed for a quote.'),
('indigenous','Indigenous flags','Respect starts with the right design.','Request flags for a specific Nation, community or organization, with the design and permission requirements confirmed before supply.','The Nation, community or organization represented|Approved artwork and permitted use|Event or permanent display context|Any community-specific display guidance','Identify the exact flag and consult the relevant Nation or organization about artwork and display expectations. Designs are not interchangeable.'),
('event','Event flags','Give your occasion a clear presence.','Use flags to frame entrances, identify gathering places and bring a coordinated look to a short-term event.','Event date and installation window|Indoor or outdoor setting|Flag quantities and placement|Rental versus custom production','Include the venue, schedule and a simple layout. Temporary displays may need venue approval and a site-specific installation plan.'),
('sports','Sports flags','Bring the team together.','Plan team and competition flags for clubs, tournaments, sports facilities and supporters’ events.','Approved team or competition artwork|Handheld, mounted or freestanding display|Venue rules and spectator circulation|Repeat events and replacement needs','Confirm authorization to reproduce any team marks. Tell us how the flags will be used and whether they need to travel between venues.'),
('feather','Feather flags','Visibility at the point of arrival.','Use vertical feather-style displays for event entrances, retail frontage and wayfinding where the setting permits.','Flag shape and overall display height|Artwork safe areas and readability|Base type and mounting surface|Exposure and venue restrictions','Share a photo of the intended placement. A base and pole must suit the selected system and the actual installation environment.'),
('banner','Banner flags','A larger canvas for your message.','Explore banner-style flags for organized displays, promotional settings and building-mounted applications.','Orientation and finished dimensions|Readable artwork at the intended distance|Mounting hardware compatibility|Site permissions and exposure','Provide the mounting arrangement or a photograph. Building-mounted displays require confirmation of fixing points and site approval.')]
POLES=[
('commercial','Commercial flagpoles','Make a lasting first impression.','Plan a display that fits the scale of an office, dealership, hotel, campus or civic property.','Site layout and clearances|Intended flag dimensions|Ground conditions and access|Maintenance and raising requirements','A site review helps establish suitable height, placement and foundation requirements. Final specifications depend on the selected pole and site.'),
('residential','Residential flagpoles','A thoughtful addition to your home.','Choose a flagpole around your property, available space and how you want to display your flag.','Ground-mounted or wall-mounted position|Neighbouring structures and overhead obstructions|Access for routine flag changes|Property permissions and local requirements','Send a photo of the intended location. We can review the setting before proposing a product and installation scope.'),
('aluminum','Aluminum flagpoles','A clean, versatile finish.','Explore aluminum poles for a broad range of commercial and residential display settings.','Finish and appearance|Internal or external halyard configuration|One-piece or sectional product options|Manufacturer-specific installation requirements','Material alone does not establish suitability. Pole dimensions, flag loading and exposure must be considered together.'),
('fiberglass','Fiberglass flagpoles','A different material. A considered choice.','Consider fiberglass alongside other pole materials when appearance, site conditions and maintenance preferences matter.','Available finish and profile|Site exposure and manufacturer guidance|Hardware and attachment compatibility|Handling and installation access','Request a comparison for your actual site. Product availability and technical suitability are confirmed for the chosen model.'),
('internal-halyard','Internal-halyard flagpoles','A cleaner line. Controlled access.','An internal halyard places the raising mechanism inside the pole, with access through a dedicated operating point.','Access control requirements|Rope or cable system options|Operating hardware and maintenance access|Compatibility with your display','Include photos of any existing access door and mechanism when requesting repair or replacement. Systems differ by manufacturer.'),
('external-halyard','External-halyard flagpoles','Straightforward access to the rope.','An external halyard runs on the outside of the pole and is typically secured to a cleat.','Cleat location and routine access|Rope condition and attachment hardware|Noise and exposure considerations|Safe flag-changing arrangements','Tell us whether this is a new pole or an existing system. A damaged rope or pulley may need professional access equipment.'),
('wall-mounted','Wall-mounted flagpoles','Use your frontage with care.','Explore angled or upright building-mounted displays where the building and mounting arrangement are suitable.','Wall material and fixing location|Projection over walkways or public space|Landlord or building approval|Access for flag changes','A photograph cannot confirm structural capacity. Fixing design and installation requirements depend on the building and selected system.'),
('portable','Portable flagpoles','A display that moves with you.','Create flexible flag displays for ceremonies, receptions, trade shows and repeat events.','Indoor or outdoor use|Base compatibility and footprint|Transport and storage needs|Flag dimensions and assembly requirements','Specify where the system will be used. An indoor stand is not automatically suitable for outdoor wind or public event conditions.'),
('temporary','Temporary flagpoles','A presence for the occasion.','Plan a short-term display for a festival, ceremony, launch or filming location.','Surface and anchoring permissions|Event dates and removal window|Pedestrian routes and barriers|Weather and venue requirements','Provide a site plan and event schedule. Temporary installation arrangements are confirmed for the surface, location and anticipated conditions.')]
def product_pages(data,base,kicker,image):
 items=[]
 for slug,title,headline,desc,points,note in data:
  path=f'/{base}/{slug}/'
  body=hero(kicker,title+'.',desc,image)
  body+=f'<section class="wrap two-column section"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RIGHT FIT</p><h2>{headline}</h2><p>{note}</p></div><div><h3>What to consider</h3><ul class="bullets">'+''.join('<li>'+x+'</li>' for x in points.split('|'))+'</ul></div></section>'
  body+=f'<section class="content-band"><div class="wrap">'+section_head('FROM BRIEF TO DISPLAY','A clear path to your quote.')+steps([('Describe the application','Tell us where and how the display will be used.'),('Share the details','Send dimensions, quantities and useful photos or artwork.'),('Review the proposal','Confirm product options, availability, pricing and scope.'),('Arrange the next step','Agree delivery or installation requirements before proceeding.')])+'</div></section>'
  body+=faq([('Can I order without knowing the exact specifications?','Yes. Send the information you have and describe the application. Product details can be clarified during the quote process.'),('Are prices and availability listed online?','Orders are quoted around the product, quantity, destination and any service requirements. Stock, lead times and suitability are confirmed for your request.')])
  body+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('COMPLETE THE DISPLAY','Related solutions.')+cards([('Custom flags','/custom-flags/','Artwork, dimensions and finishing for your design.'),('Flagpole installation','/flagpole-installation/','Plan the location, access and installation.'),('Ongoing flag service','/flag-service/','Coordinate replacement and care over time.')])+'</section>'
  add(path,title,desc,body);items.append((title,path,headline))
 add('/'+base+'/',kicker,('Explore flags for organizations, properties and events.' if base=='flags' else 'Compare commercial, residential, permanent and portable flagpole options.'),hero(kicker,('Something worth flying.' if base=='flags' else 'Give your flag a proper place.'),('From national symbols to your own identity, find a flag for the setting and the occasion.' if base=='flags' else 'Choose around your site, your display and the way you’ll use it.'),image)+'<section class="wrap section">'+cards(items)+'</section>')
product_pages(FLAGS,'flags','Flags','hero')
product_pages(POLES,'flagpoles','Flagpoles','hardware')
custom=hero('CUSTOM FLAGS','Your brand.<br>In motion.','Custom flags for company entrances, events, campuses and organizations. Start with your artwork and the place it needs to fly.','event','Navy and white fabric flags at an outdoor venue')
custom+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('FROM ARTWORK TO AIR','A considered production process.')+steps([('Upload your artwork','Send the best available logo or design file. Include colour references and brand guidance.'),('Choose the application','Share dimensions, quantity, attachment style and indoor or outdoor use.'),('Review the options','Material, construction and print requirements are considered for your setting.'),('Approve a proof','Review the agreed design before production is arranged.')])+'</section>'
custom+=split('DETAILS MAKE THE DIFFERENCE','Designed to be seen.','A flag is viewed in motion, from a distance and often from both sides. Keep the main idea clear and tell us whether precise reverse-side readability matters. Production and delivery dates are confirmed with the quote.','event','Vertical navy and white flags',button('START A CUSTOM FLAG QUOTE','Custom%20Flags'))
custom+=faq([('What artwork can I upload?','The quote form accepts PDF, SVG, AI and EPS artwork, plus JPEG, PNG and WebP reference images. Upload up to five files within the stated size limits. Vector artwork is useful for scaling; a reference image can start the conversation.'),('Can I match a corporate colour?','Include your brand colour references. Reproduction depends on the selected material and print process, so colour expectations should be reviewed before approval.'),('Can I order several sizes or versions?','Yes—list the versions and quantities in your notes. Each artwork variation and finishing requirement should be included in the quote scope.')])
add('/custom-flags/','Custom flags Canada', 'Custom corporate, event and outdoor flags. Upload artwork and request a quote for dimensions, materials, finishing and delivery.',custom)
RENTALS=[('event-flags','Event flag rentals','From a single entrance to a complete venue display.','Event format and audience circulation|Flags required and display locations|Setup and collection windows|Venue restrictions and access'),('corporate-events','Corporate event flag rentals','Bring a coordinated presence to conferences, launches and company gatherings.','Branding and national flag requirements|Stage, reception and exterior displays|Venue loading arrangements|Presentation schedule and teardown'),('festivals','Festival flag rentals','Frame the gathering places, entrances and routes across your festival.','Site layout and public circulation|Outdoor surfaces and anchoring permissions|Exposure and weather planning|Multi-day servicing and removal'),('sporting-events','Sporting event flag rentals','Support ceremonies, visiting teams and competition venues with a clear flag plan.','Participating countries or teams|Ceremony order and flag sizes|Indoor and outdoor display areas|Venue rules and event timing'),('film-production','Film production flag rentals','Find a flag display that fits the scene and the production schedule.','Specific flag design and period requirements|Continuity and duplicate quantities|Location approvals and mounting constraints|Prep, shoot and wrap dates'),('temporary-flagpoles','Temporary flagpole rentals','Add a display where you need it for the time you need it.','Surface and placement plan|Pole height and flag size|Base footprint and pedestrian clearances|Delivery, installation and collection')]
rentalhub=hero('FLAG & FLAGPOLE RENTALS','Here for the occasion.','Flags, poles, bases and installation options for events that need a strong presence without a permanent display.','event')
rentalhub+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('BUILD YOUR RENTAL','Only the pieces you need.')+cards([('Flag only','/quote/?need=Flag%20Rental','For compatible poles or stands already at your venue.'),('Flag + pole + base','/quote/?need=Flagpole%20Rental','A coordinated display system suited to your setting.'),('Full-service event package','/quote/?need=Flag%20Rental','Ask about delivery, setup and collection for your event location.')])+'</section>'
rentalhub+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('SET THE SCENE','What are you planning?')+cards([(t,'/flag-rentals/'+s+'/',d) for s,t,d,p in RENTALS])+'</section>'
rentalhub+=faq([('Can flags be used outdoors?','The selected pole, base, flag and placement must be suitable for outdoor use. Tell us about the surface and exposure so the setup can be reviewed.'),('Is delivery and installation included?','Ask for the services you need. Delivery, installation and collection are separately confirmed in the rental scope based on location and access.'),('How much notice do I need?','Share your dates as early as possible. Availability, preparation and transport requirements determine whether a rental can be arranged.')])
add('/flag-rentals/','Flag & flagpole rentals', 'Rent flags, portable poles and display packages for Canadian events, festivals, ceremonies and film productions.',rentalhub)
for s,t,d,pts in RENTALS:
 body=hero('RENTALS',t+'.',d,'event')+'<section class="wrap two-column section"><div><h2>Build the display around your event.</h2><p>Choose flag-only supply, a compatible pole and base, or a coordinated event package. Availability and installation arrangements depend on your venue, dates and scope.</p>'+button('REQUEST RENTAL QUOTE','Flag%20Rental')+'</div><div><h3>What to include in your request</h3><ul class="bullets">'+''.join('<li>'+x+'</li>' for x in pts.split('|'))+'</ul></div></section>'
 body+='<section class="content-band"><div class="wrap">'+steps([('The occasion','Share the event and rental dates, including preparation days.'),('The venue','Tell us the location, surface, indoor or outdoor use and access.'),('The display','List flag designs, quantities, poles and bases needed.'),('The logistics','Request delivery, setup and collection if required.')])+'</div></section>'
 add('/flag-rentals/'+s+'/',t,d,body)
INSTALL=[('commercial','Commercial installation','Plan a display that fits the building and the way the property operates.','Vehicle and pedestrian circulation|Underground services and site constraints|Access for installation equipment|Coordination with property management'),('residential','Residential installation','Bring a flag display to your home with the site and surroundings considered.','Property boundaries and permissions|Overhead obstructions and clearances|Landscaping and intended placement|Access for future flag changes'),('replacement','Replacement flagpole installation','Review the existing display before deciding what can be reused.','Condition of the current pole|Existing foundation and mounting details|Removal and disposal requirements|Compatibility of any retained hardware'),('multiple-flagpoles','Multiple flagpole installation','Create a coordinated display with consistent spacing and a clear arrangement.','Number and order of flags|Pole heights and display dimensions|Site layout and foundation positions|Access for ongoing service')]
install=hero('FLAGPOLE INSTALLATION','A lasting display<br>starts here.','From the first site review to the final flag check, installation starts with the conditions at your property.','hero')
install+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('FROM SITE TO SKY','A practical installation process.')+steps([('Site review','Review location, access, clearances and the intended display.'),('Selection & preparation','Agree the pole, hardware and site preparation requirements.'),('Installation','Arrange foundation work where needed and install the agreed system.'),('Final checks','Fit the flag, check operation and leave the work area tidy.')])+'</section>'
install+='<section class="wrap section">'+cards([(t,'/flagpole-installation/'+s+'/',d) for s,t,d,p in INSTALL])+'</section>'
install+=faq([('Does every pole need a foundation?','Requirements depend on the pole system and site. Permanent ground-mounted, wall-mounted and temporary systems need different preparation. The quote identifies the work needed for the chosen arrangement.'),('Can you use my existing flagpole or foundation?','Existing components need review before reuse can be agreed. Send photos, approximate dimensions and any product or installation records you have.'),('Do you handle site approvals?','Tell us about owner permissions, venue rules and any applicable local requirements. Responsibility for approvals and specialist input must be agreed in the installation scope.')])
add('/flagpole-installation/','Flagpole installation', 'Plan commercial, residential, replacement and multiple-flagpole installations with site-specific preparation and scope.',install)
for s,t,d,pts in INSTALL:
 body=hero('INSTALLATION',t+'.',d)+'<section class="wrap two-column section"><div><h2>Start with the site.</h2><p>Share photos and a proposed position before selecting a pole. Placement, access, ground or fixing conditions and product requirements all affect the installation plan.</p><p>Final foundation and fixing requirements are established for the selected system. Any specialist assessment or approvals are identified in the agreed scope.</p></div><div><h3>Planning considerations</h3><ul class="bullets">'+''.join('<li>'+x+'</li>' for x in pts.split('|'))+'</ul>'+button('REQUEST INSTALLATION QUOTE','Flagpole%20Installation')+'</div></section>'
 body+='<section class="wrap section">'+cards([('Choose a flagpole','/flagpoles/','Compare permanent and temporary display options.'),('Replacement flags','/flag-replacement/','Match flags to your finished display.'),('Ongoing maintenance','/flagpole-maintenance/','Plan care and access from the start.')])+'</section>'
 add('/flagpole-installation/'+s+'/',t,d,body)
SERVICES=[('flagpole-repair','Flagpole repair','Get the display moving again.','Describe what has stopped working, what you can see from ground level and whether the flag can still be raised or lowered.','Broken or jammed halyard|Pulley or truck assembly concerns|Damaged cleats or clips|Visible pole or hardware damage','Do not climb the pole or force a jammed mechanism. Keep clear of visibly damaged components and request an assessment.'),('flagpole-maintenance','Flagpole maintenance','Look after the whole display.','Coordinate maintenance around flag condition, operating hardware and the practical needs of your property.','Visible wear and corrosion concerns|Rope and attachment condition|Flag-change access|Seasonal service planning','Maintenance scope depends on the pole system and condition. A visual check is not a structural certification.'),('flag-replacement','Flag replacement','A fresh flag makes a difference.','Replace faded, frayed or torn flags with the design, dimensions and attachment style suited to the existing display.','Flag type and finished size|Number of flags to replace|Pole access and operating condition|One-time or scheduled replacement','Send a ground-level photo of the flag and pole. If the operating system is damaged, repair may be needed before a flag can be changed.'),('flagpole-rope-replacement','Halyard & rope replacement','Restore reliable raising and lowering.','The halyard is the rope or cable used to raise and lower a flag. The replacement must suit the pole and its operating mechanism.','Internal or external system|Broken, worn or missing rope|Pulley condition|Access and height considerations','A lost or broken halyard can require specialized access. Do not attempt to climb or improvise a replacement route.'),('flagpole-hardware-repair','Flagpole hardware repair','Small components. An important job.','Request help with clips, cleats, finials, pulleys and other hardware that supports the display.','Part photographs and manufacturer details|Symptoms or visible damage|Compatibility with existing equipment|Safe access to the affected component','Close-up photos are useful only when they can be taken safely from ground level. Do not detach load-bearing or overhead components.'),('flagpole-inspection','Flagpole inspection','Understand what needs attention.','Arrange a review of visible pole condition, flag attachments and operating hardware to identify appropriate next steps.','Visible damage or movement|Rope, clips and cleat condition|Access limitations|Service history and known concerns','Confirm the inspection scope in advance. Structural or engineering assessment is distinct from routine visual inspection and is not implied.'),('half-mast-service','Half-mast & flag raising service','A considered response, at the right time.','Request raising, lowering or half-mast support around your organization’s approved instructions and schedule.','Who authorizes the instruction|Exact lowering and raising dates|Flags and poles involved|Site access and operating condition','On-site availability and timing must be confirmed. Follow the protocol applicable to your organization and consult current official guidance.')]
for s,t,h,d,pts,note in SERVICES:
 body=hero('FLAG SERVICE',t+'.',d,'hardware','Flagpole cleat with rope and metal hardware')+'<section class="wrap two-column section"><div><h2>'+h+'</h2><p>'+note+'</p>'+button('BOOK SERVICE','Flagpole%20Repair')+'</div><div><h3>Useful details for your request</h3><ul class="bullets">'+''.join('<li>'+x+'</li>' for x in pts.split('|'))+'</ul></div></section>'
 if s=='half-mast-service':body+='<section class="wrap prose"><h2>Use the right protocol.</h2><p>Federal half-masting rules address federal buildings and establishments. Your organization may have its own applicable policy. Check the current instruction with the person responsible for your display.</p><p><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage/services/flag-canada-masting-rules.html">Canadian Heritage: rules for half-masting</a></p></section>'
 body+=faq([('What can I send before a visit?','Share the address or city, approximate pole height, a description of the issue and photos taken safely from ground level. Existing product records can help identify compatible parts.'),('Can this become part of a regular service plan?','Ask about a recurring program for flag replacement and agreed checks. Frequency, locations and included work are defined in your proposal.')])
 add('/'+s+'/',t,d,body)
add('/services/','Flagpole services','Repair, inspection, rope and hardware replacement, flag replacement and scheduled service.',hero('SERVICES','Keep your display<br>working well.','From a worn rope to a seasonal flag change, find the right next step for your property.','hardware')+'<section class="wrap section">'+cards([(t,'/'+s+'/',h) for s,t,h,d,p,n in SERVICES]+[('Commercial flag management','/flag-service/','Build a recurring plan for the way you operate.'),('Multi-location accounts','/commercial-accounts/','Coordinate several properties through one request.')])+'</section>')
service=hero('COMMERCIAL FLAG MANAGEMENT','Your flags.<br>Always looking their best.','A practical plan for flag replacement, agreed checks and ongoing care across the seasons.','hardware')
service+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('A PLAN THAT FITS','Start with how you operate.')+'<div class="program-grid">'+''.join('<div><h3>'+t+'</h3><p>'+d+'</p></div>' for t,d in [('One-time service','Resolve a specific issue or arrange a single replacement.'),('Seasonal service','Plan around the way your property changes through the year.'),('Quarterly program','Discuss a regular review and replacement schedule.'),('Multi-site program','Coordinate requirements across a commercial portfolio.')])+'</div></section>'
service+=split('AGREED SCOPE. PRACTICAL CARE.','More than a flag change.','Build a scope covering flag condition, scheduled replacement, damaged flags, visual pole checks, halyard and hardware inspection, or raising and lowering. Frequency and included tasks are agreed for each property.','hero','Flags outside landscaped commercial grounds',button('BUILD A FLAG PROGRAM','Commercial%20Flag%20Service'))
service+='<section class="wrap section">'+section_head('MAKE THE FIRST REQUEST USEFUL','Bring your property details.')+steps([('The portfolio','List locations, contacts and the number of flagpoles.'),('The display','Identify flag designs, dimensions and operating systems.'),('The priorities','Tell us about appearance standards, wear or recurring issues.'),('The schedule','Share access windows and your preferred service frequency.')])+'</section>'
add('/flag-service/','Commercial flag management','Build a recurring commercial flag service plan for inspections, replacement, hardware checks and multi-site coordination.',service)
add('/commercial-accounts/','Multi-location commercial accounts','Coordinate flag requirements for property portfolios, retail chains, dealership groups and institutions.',hero('COMMERCIAL ACCOUNTS','Many locations.<br>One clear brief.','Bring your flag requirements together across properties, regions and teams.')+'<section class="wrap two-column section"><div><h2>Start with a portfolio view.</h2><p>Share a location list, the flags you use and the service priorities at each site. A coordinated proposal can distinguish common standards from the work each property actually needs.</p><p>Reporting requirements, ordering contacts and service arrangements are agreed in the account scope.</p>'+button('TALK TO COMMERCIAL SERVICES','Multi-Location%20Program')+'</div><div><h3>What your brief can cover</h3><ul class="bullets"><li>Approved flag designs and sizes</li><li>Site contacts and access requirements</li><li>Replacement priorities and scheduling</li><li>Ordering and invoicing preferences</li><li>Requested reporting format</li></ul></div></section>')
