('commercial-buildings','Commercial buildings','A display that belongs at your entrance.','Office and industrial properties need flag displays that fit the architecture and daily movement around the site.','Visibility from approach roads and entrances|Landscaping and pedestrian clearances|Installation access around operating hours','Commercial flagpoles, corporate flags and ongoing maintenance.','Send photos of the frontage and proposed position, plus any existing pole details.'),
('municipalities','Municipalities','Thoughtful displays in shared spaces.','Civic facilities combine official identity, public events and routine property responsibilities.','Approved municipal artwork and procurement requirements|Display protocol and authorized half-mast instructions|Seasonal events across multiple facilities','Municipal and provincial flags, event rentals and scheduled flag care.','Include the procurement contact, facilities list and any prescribed product requirements.'),
