('hotels','Hotels & hospitality','A welcoming first impression.','Hospitality displays support the arrival experience while daily operations continue around them.','Guest arrival and drop-off circulation|Brand standards and international flags|Discreet service and installation windows','Corporate and international flags, pole maintenance and event rentals.','Include the brand guide, entrance photos and times when service access is least disruptive.'),
('retail','Retail & shopping centres','Visibility with a consistent identity.','Retail properties balance tenant branding, promotional activity and the needs of shared public spaces.','Landlord signage and display requirements|Seasonal campaigns and approved artwork|Pedestrian routes and exterior display permissions','Corporate flags, promotional displays and multi-location replacement plans.','Tell us who approves the display and whether it is permanent or campaign-specific.'),
('automotive','Automotive dealerships','Keep the frontage looking cared for.','Dealership displays are highly visible and often share space with vehicle movements, deliveries and customer parking.','Manufacturer brand standards|Access around inventory and customer routes|Consistent replacement across dealership groups','Corporate flags, commercial poles and scheduled flag replacement.','Provide frontage photos, approved artwork and a list of group locations where relevant.'),
