('events','Events & festivals','Bring the occasion into view.','A successful event display begins with the venue plan, timing and the way people move through the space.','Setup and teardown windows|Flag list, quantities and display sequence|Surface, weather and venue permissions','Flag rentals, portable poles, custom event flags and coordinated setup.','Share event dates, a layout and the delivery or installation services you need.'),
('sports','Sports & recreation','A display for the whole occasion.','Sports venues may need club identity, competition flags and ceremonial displays within the same event.','Approved team and competition marks|Spectator circulation and venue restrictions|Ceremony requirements and visiting teams','Sports flags, international flags and temporary event displays.','List the teams or countries, venue areas and display schedule.'),
('government','Government facilities','Clear specifications. Considered delivery.','Public-sector flag requirements may involve formal procurement, site access controls and prescribed display guidance.','Purchasing procedures and product specifications|Authorized protocol instructions|Site access and security coordination','National, provincial and institutional flags with defined installation or service scopes.','Attach the relevant specification and identify the authorized facilities or procurement contact.'),
